Text:
The 'name' of a Fearless project is ProjectName when ProjectName ".fearless" is the only file at top level in that Fearless project ending with ".fearless".
This design assumes that the modification time of a folder changes when a file or a folder is added to, removed from or renamed in that folder.
//later: a Fearless project at a path where that assumption does not hold is refused when it is registered: on Windows, FAT32 and exFAT. A later version can accept such a Fearless project by recording a hash of every input, or when the Fearless project holds only zip files at its top level.

Grammar:
FearlessPath ::= ("/" ValidSegment)*
FearlessFile ::= (FearlessPath->Content)
PackageFolder ::= "_" [a-z0-9_]*
FileNameRest ::= [a-z0-9_.]*
RankFileName ::= "_rank_" RankLevel ".fear" | "_rank_" RankLevel [0-9][0-9][0-9] ".fear"
RankLevel ::= "base" | "core" | "driver" | "worker" | "framework" | "accumulator" | "tool" | "app"
Out ::= ("json"->Content1) ("jar"->Content2) ("html"->Content3) ("txt"->Content4)
LowerJson ::= (PackageName->Content)
CompileResult ::= Out | "error(" Str ")"
OutExtension ::= ".json" | ".jar" | ".html" | ".txt" | ".unfinished"
MountedPaths ::= MountedPath1 .. MountedPathn
MountedPath ::= (TypeName->Base16)

Notation: Project.base16 = Base16 where:
- Project.#path = Infos.msg(Base16.taggedText)

Signature: frontend.rankFilesError(FearlessFiles) = Str//the text that says what is wrong in the rank files FearlessFiles; undefined when nothing is wrong

Signature: frontend.rank(FearlessPath) = Nat//the rank that the name of the rank file at FearlessPath gives; a smaller Nat is a lower rank

Signature: frontend.mapsChanged(PackageName,FearlessFiles,Content)//holds when the maps that the rank files FearlessFiles give to PackageName are not the maps that Content, the json file of PackageName, records

Signature: frontend.compile(PackageName,FearlessFiles,FearlessFiles',LowerJsons) = CompileResult//compiles the files FearlessFiles of PackageName, with the rank files FearlessFiles' and the json files of the packages of lower rank

Signature: frontend.mains(Content1 .. Contentn) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the types that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as mains

Signature: frontend.attenuators(Content1 .. Contentn) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the types that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as attenuators

Signature: frontend.dataTypes(Content1 .. Contentn) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the types that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as needing mounted data

Signature: frontend.claims(Content1 .. Contentn,OSExtension) = TypeName1 .. TypeNamem//the mains that the json files Content1 .. Contentn declare as opening the files with the extension OSExtension

Signature: frontend.shortcuts(Content1 .. Contentn) = (TypeName1->OSExtension1) .. (TypeNamem->OSExtensionm)//the Shortcut claims of the json files Content1 .. Contentn that have an extension, each with its main

Signature: frontend.shortcutName(TypeName) = SegmentBase//the name of the shortcut file of the main TypeName: the simple name of TypeName as a file name; "FooBar" gives "foo_bar"

Signature: frontend.carryChosen(Content,Content') = Content''//a json file records the claims of each main; a claim whose source names no extension is 'unchosen' until an extension is chosen for that claim; Content'' is Content where each unchosen claim has the extension that Content' records for the claim of the same main, of the same kind and with the same icon, when Content' records one

Signature: fearlessManager$jsonBase = Content//the json file of the package "base", which comes with fearlessManager

Signature: Project$runMain(TypeName,MountedPaths,InputFile)//runs the main TypeName, with the attenuators that Project.#attenuators gives to TypeName, with the Fearless projects of MountedPaths as mounted data, and with the file that InputFile encodes the path of as the input file; with "NoFile", the main has no input file

Define Project$checkShapeRules:
A action os$currentDesk() = Desk
B if not Desk.wellShaped(Desk.deskPath(Project.base16.taggedText)), error fearlessProjectErrorIsNotWellShaped(Project.base16)
//later: the Error says one broken shape rule and the paths that break that shape rule

Define Project$checkPackages:
A action Project$fearlessFiles = FearlessFile1 .. FearlessFilen
B action Project$checkPackageOf(FearlessFile1.FearlessPath) .. Project$checkPackageOf(FearlessFilen.FearlessPath)

Define Project$checkPackageOf(FearlessPath):
A if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 "/" PackageFolder FearlessPath2 "/" PackageFolder' FearlessPath3, error fearlessProjectErrorPathIsInTwoPackages(FearlessPath)
B if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 "/" PackageFolder FearlessPath2, return Project$checkPackageFolder(PackageFolder,FearlessPath)
C if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 ".fear", error fearlessProjectErrorFearFileIsInNoPackage(FearlessPath)

Define Project$checkPackageFolder(PackageFolder,FearlessPath):
A if PackageFolder is not of form "_" PackageName, error fearlessProjectErrorPackageNameIsNotValid(FearlessPath)
B if PackageFolder is "_base" or PackageFolder is "_rank", error fearlessProjectErrorPackageNameIsReserved(FearlessPath)
C if FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath1 "/_rank_" FileNameRest and FearlessPath is not of form FearlessPath1 "/" RankFileName, error fearlessProjectErrorRankFileNameIsNotValid(FearlessPath)
D fact PackageFolder = "_" PackageName
E action Project$rankFiles.filter(FearlessFile->FearlessFile.FearlessPath.contains("/_" PackageName "/")) = FearlessFile1 .. FearlessFilen
F if n is 0, error fearlessProjectErrorPackageHasNoRankFile(PackageName)
G if n is more than 1, error fearlessProjectErrorPackageHasManyRankFiles(PackageName)

Define Project$allPaths:
A action return the set of the DeskPaths at Project.base16 or inside Project.base16

Define Project$visiblePaths:
A action return the set of the DeskPaths of Project$allPaths where no Segment after Project.base16 starts with "."

Define Project$fearlessFiles:
A action return the set of the FearlessFiles that Fearless code sees inside Project.base16, including the FearlessFiles inside zip files; a zip file is not a FearlessFile, and in the FearlessPath of a FearlessFile inside a zip file, the name of that zip file is without its ending ".zip"

Define Project$fearless_out:
A action return the set of the names of the files directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Project.base16

Define Project$fearless_out+= ("x"->Content):
A action create the folder .fearless_out when Project.base16 has no folder .fearless_out
B action write the file x holding Content directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Project.base16; a file x that is there is replaced, and the file x gets a new modification time

Define Project$fearless_out+= "x":
A action Project$fearless_out+= ("x"->Content), with the empty Content

Define Project$fearless_out-= "x":
A action delete the file x directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Project.base16; nothing happens when no file x is there

Define Project$checkIsUpToDate:
A if "compile_start.txt" not in Project$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Project.base16)
B if the modification time of a DeskPath in Project$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Project.base16)
C if "last_compile_result.txt" not in Project$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Project.base16)
D if the modification time of "last_compile_result.txt" is not after the modification time of "compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Project.base16)
E fact Project.#kind = Infos.msg(Kind)
F if the Content of the file "last_compile_result.txt" directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Project.base16 is not "Accepted " Kind, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Project.base16)

Define Project$checkCanRun(TypeName):
A if Project.#kind is not Infos.msg("code"), error fearlessProjectErrorIsNotOfKindCode(Project.base16)
B action Project$checkIsUpToDate
C if TypeName is not in frontend.mains(Project$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorTypeIsNotAMain(TypeName)
D action Project$checkAttenuators(Project.#attenuators)
E action Project$checkMountedTypes(Project.#mounts)

Signature: Project$checkAttenuators(Attenuator)

Define Project$checkAttenuators(Infos.map(TypeName1, TypeNames1 .. TypeNamen, TypeNamesn)):
A if TypeNamei is not in frontend.mains(Project$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorAttenuatedMainIsNotAMain(TypeNamei)
B if Infos.msg(TypeName) in TypeNamesi and TypeName is not in frontend.attenuators(Project$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorAttenuatorIsNotAnAttenuator(TypeNamei,TypeName)

Signature: Project$checkMountedTypes(Mount)

Define Project$checkMountedTypes(Infos.map(TypeName1, Infos.msg(ProjectName1) .. TypeNamen, Infos.msg(ProjectNamen))):
A if TypeNamei is not in frontend.dataTypes(Project$jsons), error fearlessProjectErrorMountedTypeIsNotADataType(TypeNamei)
B if TypeName in frontend.dataTypes(Project$jsons) and TypeName is not one of TypeName1 .. TypeNamen, error fearlessProjectErrorDataTypeIsNotMounted(TypeName)

Define Project$jsons:
A action Project$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return fearlessManager$jsonBase Project$json(PackageName1) .. Project$json(PackageNamen)

Define Project$compile:
A action Project$checkIsUpToDate ends with done.
B fact Project.#kind = Infos.msg(Kind)
C action Project$fearless_out+= ("last_compile_result.txt"->"Accepted " Kind)

Define Project$compile:
A action Project$checkIsUpToDate ends with Error.
B action Project$fearless_out+= "compile_start.txt"
C action wait until the clock of the file system of Project.base16 is after the modification time of "compile_start.txt"
D action Project$checkShapeRules
E action Project$compileCode
F fact Project.#kind = Infos.msg(Kind)
G action Project$fearless_out+= ("last_compile_result.txt"->"Accepted " Kind)

Define Project$compileCode:
A fact Project.#kind is not Infos.msg("code").

Define Project$compileCode:
A fact Project.#kind is Infos.msg("code").
B action Project$checkPackages
C if frontend.rankFilesError(Project$rankFiles) = Str, error fearlessProjectErrorRankFilesAreNotValid(Str)
D action Project$cleanup
E action Project$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
F action Project$compilePackage(PackageName1) .. Project$compilePackage(PackageNamen)

Define Project$cleanup:
A action Project$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B if "_" PackageName OutExtension in Project$fearless_out and PackageName is not one of PackageName1 .. PackageNamen, return Project$fearless_out-= "x", for each "x" in Project$fearless_out that is not "compile_start.txt" and is not "last_compile_result.txt"
C action Project$fearless_out-= "x", for each "x" in Project$fearless_out that is not "compile_start.txt", is not "last_compile_result.txt" and is not of form "_" PackageNamei OutExtension for an i in 1..n

Define Project$packages:
A action return each PackageName where Project$files(PackageName) is not empty, ordered by Project$rank(PackageName), then by PackageName

Define Project$lower(PackageName):
A action Project$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return the list of "base" and of each PackageNamei where Project$rank(PackageNamei) < Project$rank(PackageName)

Define Project$higher(PackageName):
A action Project$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return the list of each PackageNamei where Project$rank(PackageNamei) > Project$rank(PackageName)

Define Project$lowerJsons(PackageName):
A action Project$lower(PackageName) = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return (PackageName1->Project$json(PackageName1)) .. (PackageNamen->Project$json(PackageNamen))

Signature: Project$json(PackageName) = Content

Define Project$json("base"):
A action return fearlessManager$jsonBase

Define Project$json(PackageName):
A fact PackageName is not "base"
B action return the Content of the file "_" PackageName ".json" directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Project.base16

Define Project$files(PackageName):
A action return Project$fearlessFiles.filter(FearlessFile->FearlessFile.FearlessPath.contains("/_" PackageName "/"))

Define Project$rankFiles:
A action return Project$fearlessFiles.filter(FearlessFile->FearlessFile.FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath "/" RankFileName)

Define Project$rank(PackageName):
A fact (FearlessPath "/_" PackageName FearlessPath' "/" RankFileName->Content) in Project$rankFiles
B action return frontend.rank(FearlessPath "/_" PackageName FearlessPath' "/" RankFileName)

Define Project$sharedPaths:
A action return Project$visiblePaths.filter(DeskPath->DeskPath is a folder or a zip file, and no Segment of DeskPath after Project.base16 is of form "_" PackageName)

Define Project$compilePackage(PackageName):
A if "_" PackageName ".unfinished" in Project$fearless_out, return Project$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
B if "_" PackageName ".jar" or "_" PackageName ".json" is not in Project$fearless_out, return Project$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
C if the modification time of a DeskPath of Project$visiblePaths of form DeskPath' "_" PackageName Segment1 .. Segmentn is after the modification time of "_" PackageName ".jar", return Project$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
D if the modification time of a DeskPath of Project$sharedPaths is after the modification time of "_" PackageName ".jar", return Project$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
E if frontend.mapsChanged(PackageName,Project$rankFiles,Project$json(PackageName)), return Project$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)

Define Project$withChosen(PackageName,Content):
A fact "_" PackageName ".json" not in Project$fearless_out
B action return Content

Define Project$withChosen(PackageName,Content):
A fact "_" PackageName ".json" in Project$fearless_out
B action return frontend.carryChosen(Content,Project$json(PackageName))

Define Project$forceCompilePackage(PackageName):
A action Project$higher(PackageName) = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action Project$fearless_out+= "_" PackageName ".unfinished"
C action Project$fearless_out-= "_" PackageName ".jar"
D action Project$fearless_out-= "_" PackageName1 ".jar" .. Project$fearless_out-= "_" PackageNamen ".jar"
E fact frontend.compile(PackageName,Project$files(PackageName),Project$rankFiles,Project$lowerJsons(PackageName)) = CompileResult
F if CompileResult = "error(" Str ")", error fearlessProjectErrorPackageDoesNotCompile(PackageName,Str)
G fact CompileResult = ("json"->Content1) ("jar"->Content2) ("html"->Content3) ("txt"->Content4)
H action Project$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".json"->Project$withChosen(PackageName,Content1))
I action Project$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".html"->Content3)
J action Project$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".txt"->Content4)
K action Project$fearless_out+= ("_" PackageName ".jar"->Content2)
L action wait until the clock of the file system of Project.base16 is after the modification time of "_" PackageName ".jar"
M if the modification time of a DeskPath in Project$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorFilesChangedDuringCompile(Project.base16)
N action Project$fearless_out-= "_" PackageName ".unfinished"

Implementation notes:
frontend.mapsChanged(PackageName,Project$rankFiles,Project$json(PackageName)) holds also when the packages of lower rank than PackageName are not the packages that the json file of PackageName records: a package whose rank changes, or a package of lower rank that is added or removed, is a change of the maps of PackageName. Double check that the code does this.
